Midranda manipulated the Water of Life to take control of Zarad's defeated warriors? That is horrible.
We went through a lot of trouble. Midranda recreated the Black Tide using the Quintessence, the glacial lava and the Essences of Spring. That turned our animals against us.
Thanks to the Mystic Avas, we overcame the Black Tide. But our groundwater is still contaminated.
And now the Snow Lady is attacking once more.

What? The Snow Lady is being controlled by Midranda?
And she has the lost Ice Crystal of the fairy world?
That relieves me. I thought the Snow Lady's hatred had returned. We must stop Midranda as soon as possible.

When you are ready, come back here for new instructions.
